    "body": "**Correction from the owner** (supersedes the order in my previous comment): his exact start sequence for LN2W is\n\n```\nG00 X-22. Y10.\nZ0.\nT91\nT84\nT94\nC000\nU0. V0.\nG01 X-25.838 Y10.\nG03 X-18.167 Y9.808 I3.838 J0\n```\n\n- `Z0.` on its own line, right after the X Y rapid and **before** `T91`.\n- `U0. V0.` on its own line (no G word), after the condition `C…` and **before the first cut move**, so the taper axes are vertical when cutting starts.\n- No `G21`.\n\nThis settles the U V form; nothing left open on the start sequence.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
